            <helpText>&lt;p&gt;Deletes the account&apos;s invoices with their payment schedules and generated documents, and its credit memos, canceling posted ones first. Invoices that are not Draft or Canceled need the Delete Invoice and Invoice Lines permission (permission set RLM_DeleteInvoices); without it they are kept. Payments are always kept.&lt;/p&gt;</helpText>
